      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 48,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "If no negative numbers, can solve via\nTWO Pointer sliding method\n- low, hi pointer\n- low, hi starts together = 0\n- hi increments till sum(arr[lo, hi])<= K\n- low increments when sum > K, to lower sum\n- if sum(arr[lo, hi]) == K, \n    - reset {lo, hi} together to current hi (?)\n    - restart whole process\n ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If no negative numbers, can solve via\nTWO Pointer sliding method\n- low, hi pointer\n- low, hi starts together = 0\n- hi increments till sum(arr[lo, hi])<= K\n- low increments when sum > K, to lower sum\n- if sum(arr[lo, hi]) == K, \n    - reset {lo, hi} together to current hi (?)\n    - restart whole process\n ",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 564
    },
